    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/cbca6d13109dca9cfd27d53c7c3badb7.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Diamond Town\u2014where legends come to life! Picture this wild town\u00a0crazy about card battles, hosting its grandest event: the\u00a0Diamond Town Card King Tournament! Ready to face\u00a0crafty card masters? Outsmart rivals in\u00a0electrifying duels, rise to the top, and become the next legendary Card King!\u00a0Yes, we\u2019re talking about YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/83c1b1ba2f178053ad8e4f3fba995b79.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heads up! Master your grid!</strong> Command\u00a0the unique 3x3 board\u2014every placement\u00a0counts, every position\u00a0shapes your victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dazzling Sacrifices! Turn the Tide!</strong> At critical moments,\u00a0sacrifice cards\u00a0for\u00a0game-breaking power\u2014watch jaws drop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Link \u2018em up! Reap the Rewards!</strong> Align cards to form brilliant lines, trigger\u00a0juicy combo bonuses, and leave rivals scrambling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every step\u2019s a dance!</strong> Sequence? Positioning? Sacrifice timing? Combos?\u00a0My friend, weave these tactics together\u00a0and outplay them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/72fad019f3e620476ad50d397a790b57.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover\u00a0tons of cards, quirky toys, and wild items\u2014unearth\u00a0endless synergies\u00a0and\u00a0magical combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions!\u00a0Mix and match freely, build a deck\u00a0bursting with personality\u2014packed with\u00a0mind-blowing fun!\u00a0Bet it\u2019ll be one-of-a-kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.mp4?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/8a13170660e73b236859cc9fe8ec09d7.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brainless moves here!\u00a0Every swap, every setup, every choice shifts the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relish\u00a0pure strategic bliss. Outmaneuver foes in\u00a0heart-pumping, grin-inducing duels\u2014taste that sweet, sweet triumph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.mp4?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/d2ec03065f93400c3816705ad55f52ee.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0ever-changing cards, quirky gear, and shiny toys...\u00a0each time you enter Diamond Town, pal, you begin a BRAND-NEW quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys alike!\u00a0Infinite novelty\u00a0ensures\u00a0exciting, laughter-filled escapades\u2014gear up for the unexpected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2aacf556e496948036ed826177c81c36.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2aacf556e496948036ed826177c81c36.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/cbca6d13109dca9cfd27d53c7c3badb7.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Diamond Town\u2014where legends come to life! Picture this wild town\u00a0crazy about card battles, hosting its grandest event: the\u00a0Diamond Town Card King Tournament! Ready to face\u00a0crafty card masters? Outsmart rivals in\u00a0electrifying duels, rise to the top, and become the next legendary Card King!\u00a0Yes, we\u2019re talking about YOU!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/83c1b1ba2f178053ad8e4f3fba995b79.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heads up! Master your grid!</strong> Command\u00a0the unique 3x3 board\u2014every placement\u00a0counts, every position\u00a0shapes your victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dazzling Sacrifices! Turn the Tide!</strong> At critical moments,\u00a0sacrifice cards\u00a0for\u00a0game-breaking power\u2014watch jaws drop!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Link \u2018em up! Reap the Rewards!</strong> Align cards to form brilliant lines, trigger\u00a0juicy combo bonuses, and leave rivals scrambling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every step\u2019s a dance!</strong> Sequence? Positioning? Sacrifice timing? Combos?\u00a0My friend, weave these tactics together\u00a0and outplay them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/72fad019f3e620476ad50d397a790b57.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover\u00a0tons of cards, quirky toys, and wild items\u2014unearth\u00a0endless synergies\u00a0and\u00a0magical combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No restrictions!\u00a0Mix and match freely, build a deck\u00a0bursting with personality\u2014packed with\u00a0mind-blowing fun!\u00a0Bet it\u2019ll be one-of-a-kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/305da530c41f83ad39bccdbd0619be73.mp4?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/8a13170660e73b236859cc9fe8ec09d7.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No brainless moves here!\u00a0Every swap, every setup, every choice shifts the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relish\u00a0pure strategic bliss. Outmaneuver foes in\u00a0heart-pumping, grin-inducing duels\u2014taste that sweet, sweet triumph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/4a8194251fc1fc27fa1ce98eca53c222.mp4?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/d2ec03065f93400c3816705ad55f52ee.avif?t=1755621432\" width=1560 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0ever-changing cards, quirky gear, and shiny toys...\u00a0each time you enter Diamond Town, pal, you begin a BRAND-NEW quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys alike!\u00a0Infinite novelty\u00a0ensures\u00a0exciting, laughter-filled escapades\u2014gear up for the unexpected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2aacf556e496948036ed826177c81c36.poster.avif?t=1755621432\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875210/extras/2aacf556e496948036ed826177c81c36.webm?t=1755621432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
